WEBVTT

00:13.028 --> 00:16.231
You brought your tray of silver plate You

00:16.251 --> 00:19.774
thought you'd open up the gate You showed me

00:19.854 --> 00:24.038
powder on a glass You thought you had a man of

00:24.078 --> 00:28.522
class It was just, it was just a lie So I wiped it

00:28.562 --> 00:32.426
clean and I watched you die You called it art, you

00:32.446 --> 00:36.129
called it style It was just garbage in a filthy

00:36.169 --> 00:36.570
pile

00:40.247 --> 00:43.730
You held your clipboard like a gun You thought

00:43.750 --> 00:47.334
the battle was already won You crossed the line,

00:47.374 --> 00:50.196
you showed your hand You'll never ever

00:50.497 --> 00:54.921
understand It was just, it was just a lie So I

00:54.981 --> 00:58.504
wiped it clean and I watched you die You called it

00:58.844 --> 01:02.468
art, you called it style It was just garbage in a

01:02.488 --> 01:03.449
filthy pile

01:26.963 --> 01:31.688
It was just, it was just a lot. So I wiped clean and

01:31.889 --> 01:35.292
I washed you guy. You called it out, cause you're

01:35.373 --> 01:36.854
a fake. It was just garbage.

